Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:11.99,Sumer,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,900)}{\fade(3107,979)}By the wall, I will say a word to you.\NTake my word.\NGive ear to my instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:11.99,Sumer,,0,0,0,,{\pos(845,1010)}{\fs40}{\fade(3107,979)}(Ancient Sumerian clay tablet)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:16.99,Year,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,613.333)}{\fade(2065,0)}2199 {\fs70}AD
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.91,0:00:22.33,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,I repeat, this is the 7th Cosmo Marine Regiment calling from the Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.33,0:00:27.46,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We were attacked by enemy carrier-based fighters\Nand are stranded on the Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:29.00,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Have taken heavy losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.46,0:00:32.00,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Requesting evac. Requesting evac.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.17,0:00:34.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure that thing is fixed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.13,0:00:35.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:43.01,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is the 7th Cosmo Marine regiment calling from the Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.01,0:00:48.06,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We were attacked by enemy carrier-based fighters\Nand are stranded on the Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:47.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:49.90,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Have taken heavy losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:52.00,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Requesting evac. Requesting evac.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:52.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Saito?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.77,0:00:54.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a face to wake up to...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.98,0:00:57.11,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is the 7th Cosmo Marine Regiment calling from the Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.11,0:01:02.10,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We were attacked by enemy carrier-based fighter\N and are stranded on the Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:03.97,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Have taken heavy losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.97,0:01:04.79,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Requesting evac.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.99,0:01:02.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Transmit all you want, it won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.89,0:01:03.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kurata!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:04.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.16,0:01:09.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The top brass have forgotten we even exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.37,0:01:11.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll come for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.63,0:01:14.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't give up as long as there's life left in us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:18.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to be a Cosmo Marine.\NNever forget that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.13,0:01:20.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.19,0:01:38.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.31,0:01:41.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a ship like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.45,0:01:43.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not Gamilan, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.16,0:01:45.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cosmo Navy, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.41,0:01:46.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:01:58.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel, there's a friendly out there!\NHelp has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:06.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:12.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.69,0:02:20.65,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We're about to leave lunar orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.65,0:02:24.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maintain heading.\NAll ahead half.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:26.77,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,All ahead half, aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.24,0:02:29.37,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.37,0:02:31.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No unauthorized personnel on the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.13,0:02:33.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Move it! I have something to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:34.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.59,0:02:37.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're this boat's captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:41.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you'd shown up sooner, my regiment wouldn't have been wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:43.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were getting our mayday, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.40,0:02:44.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you wait so‒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.47,0:02:46.26,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,I'm the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.76,0:02:48.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then who‒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.22,0:02:51.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Commander, UN Cosmo Force Space Defense Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.19,0:02:54.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Admiral Hijikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:03:02.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To defeat the Gamilans and restore our home to her blue state.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.53,0:03:05.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were deployed to provide escort
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.66,0:03:08.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,for a special ship that's been tasked with that mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.66,0:03:12.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you're saying that rescuing us was just an afterthought, sir?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:13.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.63,0:03:18.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That ship we saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.84,0:03:20.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:26.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We fought and died for this, too! We have a right to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.18,0:03:27.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.97,0:03:29.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.31,0:03:31.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.35,0:03:33.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right, the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.77,0:03:35.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The space battleship Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:38.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Helmed by my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.76,0:03:40.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And also...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:43.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...the last hope of the human race.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:38.90,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,I am Melda Ditz, 707th Air Wing, Milky Way Theater Forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:42.86,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,If you ever lose a close family member in this war, you'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:45.93,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We can trust each other. That's what my gut tells me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:49.56,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,These Gatlanteans are nothing to fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:50.89,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Calm yourself, Berger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.89,0:04:53.75,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,The more cunning the prey, the more satisfying the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.75,0:04:57.11,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Those ruins were left behind by the race that built the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.11,0:04:59.80,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Now I am all alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:02.36,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Open all gun ports! Shoot down the Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.17,0:05:22.11,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We are hereby abandoning the Yamato Project.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.11,0:05:24.00,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,This has to end here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:26.63,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Steady as she goes! All ahead, emergency speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:29.01,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,If we don't take a gamble to snatch victory from the jaws of defeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.01,0:05:30.53,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,we'll never break through this blockade!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.53,0:05:31.70,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,This is the Okita Gambit...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:34.14,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Wave Motion Gun, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:40.60,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Lay in course 728. Destination, the Rainbow Cluster! All ships, lift off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.71,0:05:47.34,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Here's a present! Accept it with my compliments!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.34,0:05:50.07,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Yuki! Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:56.56,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,So, Heaven is telling me to destroy the Yamato myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.56,0:06:00.75,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,You think I'm going to let it end this way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.48,0:06:04.67,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Glory and blessings to Gamilas!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.53,0:06:14.97,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Your people repurposed wave motion energy as a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.97,0:06:16.97,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,I shall make alterations to this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.97,0:06:21.69,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,And the Yamato herself will become integral\Nto the Cosmo Reverse System.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:35.54,Summary,,0,0,0,,{\pos(980,635)}{\fade(1530,1100)}7 months since the Yamato set sail from Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:41.58,Summary,,0,0,0,,{\pos(980,635)}{\fade(1530,1100)}Intergalactic space outside the Large Magellanic Cloud
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:57.56,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:06:59.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It certainly seems to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.39,0:07:03.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Baleras has fallen\Nand Chancellor Dessler has died in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:05.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine news, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:09.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd thought that after failing to assassinate Dessler,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:12.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we would be doomed to wander the cosmos forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:17.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if he has died and his regime has fallen...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:19.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Returning home is no longer a pipe dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.83,0:07:21.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:21.25,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What's that? Gravity tremors dead ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.38,0:07:23.00,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Lt. General Bandevel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:23.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:33.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that?! What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:36.39,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Multiple enemy vessels detected outside our firing range dead ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.18,0:07:39.41,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Identifying ship types...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:41.19,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,They're Gatlantean!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:43.64,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Filthy barbarians! Counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.25,0:08:12.76,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Fleet attrition rate, 95 {\i0}barsel{\i}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:14.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-We're being wiped out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:16.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What {\i1}is{\i} that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.55,0:08:20.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Barbarians have such technology?\NNo, it's not possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.26,0:08:21.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do we do, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.72,0:08:22.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:25.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Sehrgut's front armor can withstand anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.91,0:08:46.71,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:52.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go to full speed!\NHurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.83,0:09:27.88,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,Have you learned your lesson,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:30.50,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,you blue Gamilan vermin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.09,0:09:44.06,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Personal log, Mikage Kiryu, Technical Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:47.56,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,It's been a month since the Yamato set sail from Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:52.69,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,and the ship will soon leave the LMC's outer rim\Nand enter intergalactic space.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:54.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Comms Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.15,0:09:57.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shift change, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.28,0:10:03.32,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Having received the Cosmo Reverse System,\Nmorale aboard the ship is high.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.45,0:10:05.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, Ichikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.37,0:10:07.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold the fort.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:08.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.62,0:10:11.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.59,0:10:13.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Saijo will relieve me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.55,0:10:22.93,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Starsha's mediation, the threat from Gamilas is behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.93,0:10:26.60,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,But over the course of our journey to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.60,0:10:29.06,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,we've lost a great many shipmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:34.64,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,But even as we sail on,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.64,0:10:37.53,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,the people waiting back on Earth for the Yamato to return
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:41.44,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,are fighting against the fear of the extinction that looms ever closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.87,0:10:48.54,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We continue to carry out our daily duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.66,0:10:53.48,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,For our families and loved ones waiting on Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:56.42,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,for our shipmates who fell with the mission still unfinished,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:58.71,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,we'll do everything in our power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.71,0:11:00.05,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.05,0:11:05.35,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,And as for me, my days are spent analyzing alien languages
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.35,0:11:07.87,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,with Lt. Niimi, my immediate superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:10.64,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,If we can build a rudimentary translation device,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:14.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it should allow us to make friendly contact with aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.06,0:11:16.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Signing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.61,0:11:23.03,Call,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1178.666,129.333)\frx26\fry12\frz9.483}{\blur0.9}Incoming Call
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.99,0:11:26.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.37,0:11:28.83,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Do you know what time it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.79,0:11:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.13,0:11:37.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dinner! Dinner! Dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:39.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! Oh, crap! Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:42.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dinner! Dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.33,0:11:44.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.13,0:11:48.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C'mon Shino, hurry up‒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:53.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.61,0:12:02.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish {\i1}I{\i} had free time like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:03.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wha‒?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.41,0:12:08.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:13.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It would've been cuter if she'd been eating a piece of toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:16.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiryu Mikage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.99,0:12:19.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tech Division ace, personally scouted by Miss Niimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:21.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A linguist in the making.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:24.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're full of facts, Nemo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.38,0:12:25.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's not cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:27.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not one damn bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.51,0:12:33.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was that really a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.72,0:12:35.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're being paranoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:38.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iscandar mediated an agreement with Gamilas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:40.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.36,0:12:45.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I sure hope you're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:52.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, we'll have to make do\Nwithout the Wave Motion Gun now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.41,0:12:58.00,DWMIE,,0,0,0,,{\move(948,250.333,948,269,29,4534)}{\t(0,4576,\fscx95\fscy95)}{\fade(0,1516)}{\blur0.9}Dimensional Wave Motion Implosion Emitter\NEmitter Aperture Plug
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.02,0:13:17.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Kodai, sir. May I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.53,0:13:32.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be in bed, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.78,0:13:35.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel good today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:36.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.97,0:13:41.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing, sir. I'm not here on any business in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:48.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's an old tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.72,0:13:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was originally a German folk song.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.93,0:13:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.47,0:13:56.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a version of this with Japanese lyrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:14:02.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's about friends who part, hoping that they will be reunited.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.40,0:14:08.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Partings are difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.86,0:14:11.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But people always meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.12,0:14:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had a reunion, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.54,0:14:18.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.33,0:14:23.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It turned out to be a final farewell, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:29.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if it was just a video,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:31.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that I got to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.59,0:14:35.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How he lived, how he cared for others,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.93,0:14:38.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and what his parting words would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.23,0:14:42.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel like I know now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.73,0:14:46.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The first time I met Mamoru Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.23,0:14:51.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, he must have been about the same age you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.57,0:14:56.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish he could have served aboard this ship with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:14:59.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.41,0:15:03.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the strangest thing.\NI feel like he's still here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:06.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.34,0:15:11.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm interested in hearing that version\Nyou mentioned with the Japanese lyrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:16.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll put in a request for it on Misaki's radio show, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.22,0:15:20.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think that's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.74,0:15:32.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,House call!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.61,0:15:34.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.07,0:15:34.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:37.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.70,0:15:40.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:44.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be going, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.25,0:15:50.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.51,0:15:54.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop by to visit again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.05,0:15:56.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.43,0:16:00.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two are like father and son!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:04.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.53,0:16:18.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.33,0:16:26.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:28.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.39,0:16:31.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've been doing the same thing as me, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.86,0:16:38.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While he was on Iscandar, your brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.98,0:16:47.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, Yamamoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.23,0:16:48.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:51.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Having a sibling is a great thing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.61,0:16:53.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.95,0:16:59.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.62,0:17:02.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you hanging out here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.93,0:17:05.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm off shift at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.05,0:17:14.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.67,0:17:18.68,1418207,,0,0,0,,{\frz15.30\pos(1309.334,661.667)}{\blur0.7}Gamilan multi-language translator
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:21.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now to translate the Gatlantean into Jirellan...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.43,0:17:22.89,TimeFlows,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1394.667,184.333)}{\blur0.6}Like a river, time flows, finding its way back to the distant depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.01,0:17:24.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm making good progress...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.65,0:17:26.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're as fast as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:30.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've also installed it into my head
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.02,0:17:33.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I'll be able to use it in an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:49.78,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,My assignment just came in a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:54.13,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Get this, it's a huge coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:57.73,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, it's the same unit as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.51,0:18:03.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meria, I went and survived again...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.47,0:18:06.39,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,So we'll always be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.77,0:18:13.69,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Fomt, let's go see Koronarl at night with my sister‒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:13.69,Dialogue2,,0,0,0,,Message, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.40,0:18:16.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acting Captain Berger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.49,0:18:18.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Major" is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.03,0:18:19.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.23,0:18:21.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, you're requested on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.36,0:18:23.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:32.04,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Inertial control's out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:35.00,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Yeah. They say it's gonna take a while to get it back online.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.96,0:18:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've brought him, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.97,0:18:43.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.47,0:18:46.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The ship's intercom is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.01,0:18:48.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's showing her age, just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:50.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good work, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.85,0:18:52.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Garle Dessler!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.44,0:18:59.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, what is it, Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.32,0:19:02.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've received orders from the MP Fleet to come to a halt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.95,0:19:06.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With the captain dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.41,0:19:10.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you're the ranking officer aboard the ship, Berger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.86,0:19:14.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are your orders? Do we stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.29,0:19:17.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We ignore them, obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:19.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.67,0:19:25.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The orders came from the Gelvades-class Mirangal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.57,0:19:28.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Mirangal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:30.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:35.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From her ship, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.41,0:19:55.42,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Inertial control restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:59.55,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Repair crews, you may work with your magnetic shoes turned off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.59,0:20:03.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care what the top brass decided,\NI can't do that after all they've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.92,0:20:06.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Any attacks against the Yamato are forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.63,0:20:07.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.76,0:20:10.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who could obey an order like‒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.40,0:20:12.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.44,0:20:17.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I can't accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:17.40,Dialogue2,,0,0,0,,Here, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.19,0:20:20.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.22,0:20:28.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pardon the interruption!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:34.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to destroy that thing, the Yamato, personally!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.00,0:20:37.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to make them pay for killing Gen. Domel and my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.99,0:20:39.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.43,0:20:48.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still the same old foolish man, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.83,0:20:51.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was born that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.39,0:20:53.64,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,So, how was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.06,0:20:56.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Major was livid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.19,0:20:58.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.60,0:21:02.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The captain of the Mirangal was so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.15,0:21:04.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Little Miss Neredia, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.77,0:21:05.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Little Miss"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.15,0:21:09.91,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Your crew is nothing but old-timers and child soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.49,0:21:13.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want to start playing war again
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.45,0:21:15.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and get even little boys like that mixed up in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:17.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:19.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reconcile with the Terrons?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.24,0:21:21.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen. Domel,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:25.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Getto, Kraitz, Old Man Heydeln!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.17,0:21:27.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They were all killed by those people!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.68,0:21:31.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like when you got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.60,0:21:42.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.98,0:21:45.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we should leave this sector as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:50.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A witch lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.99,0:21:56.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone who entices sailors with her beautiful voice
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.33,0:21:59.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and gobbles up their very souls? That kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.46,0:22:04.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Countless ships have vanished from these coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.38,0:22:06.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Countless.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.89,0:22:10.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a load of garbage. Superstitious nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:22.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bridge! Why are you playing a song over the intercom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.06,0:22:24.48,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Sir? No one is playing a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.79,0:22:26.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you call this singing, then?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.53,0:22:29.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't hear any singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:32.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fomt?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.92,0:22:43.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Occupied, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.13,0:22:45.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Waiting for someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.80,0:22:50.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh... Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.04,0:22:56.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.39,0:23:02.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.77,0:23:04.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.36,0:23:13.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.21,0:23:17.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be such a baby. It'll make memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.20,0:23:22.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now, a shot of our two lovely ladies in their finery!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.64,0:23:26.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yamamoto, let's get a shot together!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.64,0:23:29.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, ladies! Say cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.65,0:23:52.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.40,0:23:56.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who gave the order to fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.32,0:23:59.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.94,0:24:01.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's the Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.02,0:24:02.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He isn't on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.91,0:24:05.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whose ships are they? Gamilas?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.54,0:24:09.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hailed them using standard Gamilan codes,\Nbut there was no reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.80,0:24:11.05,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Radar returns!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.05,0:24:13.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Large vessels!\NCount, 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.10,0:24:19.43,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,Matching data.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.72,0:24:20.93,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the Terron Yamatte!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.14,0:24:23.56,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,Attack squadron has struck the first spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.98,0:24:25.85,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,Transmit visuals to Megaruda!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.48,0:24:28.31,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,Visuals from advance strike group!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.56,0:24:31.48,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,So, this is the notorious Terron ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.73,0:24:35.28,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,Surely the gods have sent them to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.79,0:24:50.29,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll steal that ship's gun that can annihilate Gamilas
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.54,0:24:54.17,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,and present it to His Great Imperial Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.38,0:24:59.60,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,Victory to Dagum!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.81,0:25:02.35,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,Glory to the clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.91,0:25:22.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Multiple vessels to aft!\NComing out of warp!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.80,0:25:35.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Their main force is here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.92,0:25:38.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Their commanding officer is hailing us!\NVideo transmission!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.97,0:25:40.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First contact...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.02,0:25:44.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Respond to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.52,0:25:52.86,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,In the name of His Great Imperial Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.19,0:25:54.44,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,Terron,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.61,0:25:56.15,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,I suggest you listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.53,0:25:58.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Language match. Gatlantean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.36,0:26:02.82,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,My name is "Thunderclap" Goran Dagum,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.78,0:26:08.16,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander of the Gatlantean Gudaba Expeditionary Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.41,0:26:10.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Kodai, ship's Tactical Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.89,0:26:14.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have no intent to fight.\NWe ask that you call off your attack immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.17,0:26:18.31,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Battle is a Warrior's honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.31,0:26:21.39,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,To withdraw troops is the act of a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.84,0:26:24.64,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,There can be no peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.01,0:26:29.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When your fighters suddenly attacked us,\Nwe were forced to respond in kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.14,0:26:33.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are in the middle of a journey.\NWe don't want any trouble with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.75,0:26:34.78,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,I laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.98,0:26:42.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I order you in the name of His Great Imperial Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.24,0:26:48.87,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Terrons, surrender to my forces and hand over your ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.08,0:26:50.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.96,0:27:00.88,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Well said.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.77,0:27:03.20,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,If that is your wish...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.26,0:27:10.81,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,...I will grant you an honorable death.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.73,0:27:14.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're going to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.18,0:27:16.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All hands, go to level 1 battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.86,0:27:27.66,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We aboard the Kiska struck the first spear against the Yamatte!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.24,0:27:31.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We will lift their head high for all to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.48,0:27:35.67,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Enemy formation closing in from dead ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.67,0:27:37.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Load fore and aft torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.11,0:27:38.80,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Shall I launch fighters?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.80,0:27:39.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.96,0:27:43.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy will attack the instant we deploy our Falcons.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.24,0:27:44.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stand by to drop mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.98,0:27:47.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our goal is strictly to defend the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.97,0:27:50.47,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}All hands to level 1 battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.06,0:27:57.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer to avoid combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.77,0:28:00.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it, if only we could use the Wave Motion Gun...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.90,0:28:05.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayashi, report any astronomical bodies\Nin our immediate vicinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.16,0:28:13.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spare any engineers who could serve the empire as science slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.21,0:28:15.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But kill the warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.71,0:28:19.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if they are women, do not spare them!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.84,0:28:29.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fighter formation closing in from 1 o'clock!\NDestroyers closing in from 6 o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.07,0:28:30.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Distance, 8,000!\NCount, 7!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.52,0:28:32.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready to engage!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.44,0:28:33.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.56,0:28:36.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Off our 3 o'clock!\NA free-floating planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.73,0:28:39.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make for the planet!\NHard to starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.19,0:28:41.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're running?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.57,0:28:43.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.72,0:29:13.60,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Fighter formation wiped out!\NEnemy vessels closing in!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.49,0:29:28.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ventral hull hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.56,0:29:29.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damage control!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.49,0:29:31.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.93,0:29:39.12,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Destroyer eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.12,0:29:41.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayashi, forward the planet's data for analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.67,0:29:44.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sending data to Operations Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.05,0:29:45.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Data received.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.33,0:29:46.88,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Trailing ships closing in!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.88,0:29:49.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Raise Wave Motion Barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.10,0:30:02.81,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Turn us around!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.15,0:30:05.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Firestorm Direct Strike Gun! Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.94,0:30:08.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fleeing to that planet, eh?\NIt won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.45,0:30:10.41,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Firestorm Direct Strike Gun! Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.70,0:30:10.41,Off-Screen2,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Activating energy dampers!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.31,0:30:17.10,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Inputting relative impact coordinates!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.10,0:30:19.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pressure climbing in firing chamber!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.35,0:30:24.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Open energy transport jump conduits!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.05,0:30:33.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lock on target!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.72,0:30:43.86,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Gliade has struck out too far ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.86,0:30:47.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn that Gliade... Always in a rush for glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.57,0:30:48.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.95,0:30:51.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if we wait, it will throw off the transport coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.63,0:30:52.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.41,0:30:58.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bear witness to the light of Gatlantis!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.20,0:31:03.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Firestorm Direct Strike Gun, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.55,0:31:14.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What {\i1}is{\i} that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.47,0:31:17.31,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Barrier deflection rate falling!\NDamage to hull plating!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.93,0:31:18.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That wasn't a direct hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.55,0:31:21.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It only grazed us?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.10,0:31:23.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Radar, pinpoint firing location!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.03,0:31:26.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unable to calculate trajectory!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.06,0:31:27.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It must have appeared out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.70,0:31:36.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It would seem that the enemy can attack\Nfrom outside our own firing range.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.49,0:31:38.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Commander...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.55,0:31:44.25,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Advance ship Gliade destroyed!\NTerron ship... intact!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.92,0:31:46.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They won't die, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.54,0:31:52.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, that makes that ship all the more worthy\Nto present to His Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.59,0:31:54.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Main enemy force closing in!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.38,0:31:55.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Analysis complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.72,0:31:58.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The planet possesses a complicated cavity structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.85,0:32:01.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.06,0:32:03.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we stay out here, we'll be a sitting duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.14,0:32:04.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.03,0:32:06.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.20,0:32:09.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going down to the planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.83,0:32:24.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Terron ship descending to the planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.12,0:32:28.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Target their propulsion and force them to make a soft landing!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.04,0:32:31.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We will then attack with troops and take the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.59,0:32:33.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vanguard ships, force them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.61,0:33:24.73,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Enemy ships overhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.73,0:33:25.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Start firing SAMs!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.89,0:33:26.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.78,0:34:21.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Multiple unknown targets have appeared to aft!\NThey are not ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.11,0:34:22.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still increasing in number!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.09,0:34:36.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unknown targets have latched on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.21,0:34:39.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Life signs detected in unknown objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.68,0:34:43.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tendrils entering through hull breaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.99,0:34:43.68,Dialogue2,,0,0,0,,Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.53,0:34:59.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the‒?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.65,0:35:02.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wave Motion Barrier output falling!\NBarrier collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.96,0:35:13.63,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Main engine output falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.63,0:35:16.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, we're dead in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.17,0:35:18.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unknown targets have latched onto enemy ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.14,0:35:35.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A space life form with the ability to absorb energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.19,0:35:37.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kodai, if we don't do something, the ship will‒
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.32,0:35:39.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roll the ship! Roll us and shake them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.02,0:35:40.83,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.54,0:35:47.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're not budging!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.75,0:35:50.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wave motion energy drain, 80%!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.50,0:35:52.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be dead in the water in minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.92,0:36:00.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All hands, prepare to go to warp!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.59,0:36:04.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think we should warp immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.77,0:36:06.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.01,0:36:08.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we stay here, we're dead in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.39,0:36:12.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we leave the planet,\Nwe'll be a sitting duck for that weapon again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.60,0:36:14.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We should do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.35,0:36:17.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since they are an unknown life form,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.78,0:36:21.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the dimensional resonance of a warp might dislodge them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.57,0:36:22.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.19,0:36:24.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kodai is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.20,0:36:27.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to roll the dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.57,0:36:31.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep her spinning!\NDon't let her go out!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.04,0:36:33.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Burn out the parts if you have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.41,0:36:36.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep her spinning at full power!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.17,0:36:46.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Energy threshold needed for warp in 10 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.95,0:36:56.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Five seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.86,0:37:01.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Warp!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.85,0:37:35.14,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Gravity interference waves detected on planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.64,0:37:38.39,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Terron ship appears to have performed spatial jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.74,0:37:52.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm seething with rage!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.26,0:38:11.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.59,0:38:13.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is everyone all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.70,0:38:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where in the world are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.83,0:38:36.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of crazy space is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.58,0:38:37.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.33,0:38:42.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Warning. Mainframe is being tampered with by outside force.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.47,0:39:00.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The helm isn't‒ The ship's moving by itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.14,0:39:03.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Situation report! Are there any ships in the area?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.15,0:39:04.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ch-Checking!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.15,0:39:06.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing on radar!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.32,0:39:08.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing on my screen!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.85,0:39:10.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Determine current position!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.28,0:39:14.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No stars are observable!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.03,0:39:16.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true... Not a single one!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.83,0:39:20.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Yamato appears to have wandered\Ninto some sort of void space
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.54,0:39:23.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that is cut off from our own universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.63,0:39:27.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Helm not responding.\NAutopilot will not disengage.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.92,0:39:29.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Power down engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.59,0:39:31.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Power down engines!\NPower down!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.01,0:39:33.76,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.76,0:39:36.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're trying, but she's not doing a thing we say!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.90,0:39:39.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where the heck are we headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.06,0:39:50.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sanada, we've been in a situation like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.28,0:39:54.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we assume it's the same as before...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.19,0:39:54.12,Off-Screen2,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.48,0:39:56.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.08,0:40:04.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...it would most likely make that world our destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.25,0:40:08.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing ventured, and all that...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.88,0:40:57.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Planetary surface confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.62,0:40:59.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Current altitude, 4,200.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.85,0:41:03.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The planet's surface is composed of some liquid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.66,0:41:09.52,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Speed has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.52,0:41:12.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Radar return! Massive floating object dead ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.67,0:41:31.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This would appear to be the end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.94,0:42:25.31,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,An enclosed void space, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.31,0:42:27.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is just a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.43,0:42:30.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By all rights, a space such as this should not exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.22,0:42:32.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is impossible, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.81,0:42:35.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet, here we are inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.69,0:42:42.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This structure floating above the planet is clearly artificial in origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.95,0:42:45.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Add to that the loss of control of the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.62,0:42:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we may assume that some conscious mind has brought us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.54,0:42:53.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I may offer an opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.54,0:42:53.50,Dialogue2,,0,0,0,,If I may offer an opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.67,0:43:02.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.68,0:43:03.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.60,0:43:05.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.10,0:43:06.03,Dialogue2,,0,0,0,,You're our driver, Sawamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.03,0:43:08.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be right‒
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.09,0:43:09.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.96,0:43:12.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll get you there safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.94,0:43:18.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you should be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.73,0:43:19.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I‒
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.40,0:43:22.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.00,0:43:33.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that opening up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.17,0:43:36.81,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Rotate left! Lower boom! Extend boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.76,0:43:48.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.\NThey're sending {\i1}that{\i} out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.06,0:43:53.35,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We had something like that aboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.77,0:43:58.26,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,The Ki-8 prototype space boat.\NAKA "Stork."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.24,0:44:06.95,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,It's an unlisted reserve aircraft.\NIt's a special-purpose planetary recon boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.95,0:44:08.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean it's‒
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.33,0:44:10.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's what it was for.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.20,0:44:12.87,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Oh, so basically,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.87,0:44:16.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you were planning to use this\Nonce you'd pulled off your mutiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.42,0:44:17.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sawamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.84,0:44:19.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.45,0:44:21.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I just meant‒
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.84,0:44:25.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.84,0:44:29.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all right.\NAfter all, it's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.16,0:44:55.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Depth, 50. 55...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.06,0:44:57.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,60.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.56,0:45:01.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Singing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.09,0:45:07.09,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,This is the Yamato.\NStork, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.44,0:45:09.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Report your status!\NAihara!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.56,0:45:13.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Communications with the Stork have been cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.93,0:45:16.14,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.52,0:45:18.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something strange is happening to the planet's surface!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.22,0:45:54.29,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.52,0:45:58.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like a world straight out of myth...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.06,0:46:02.90,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,I almost feel like God is toying with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.86,0:46:12.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tactical Officer!\NReceiving Gamilan mayday!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.76,0:46:30.93,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Nitrogen, 78.1%.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.93,0:46:34.51,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Atmospheric pressure, 1018 hectopascals.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.51,0:46:37.22,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Atmospheric composition and climate closely resemble
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.22,0:46:39.73,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,that of a tropical rainforest on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.73,0:46:42.72,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,No toxic substances detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.67,0:47:00.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll continue on foot from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.56,0:47:03.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.92,0:47:09.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,-50 decibels... Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.13,0:47:17.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on... It's crazy to take a Gammie SOS seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.10,0:47:20.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there even any point to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.06,0:47:21.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.90,0:47:24.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was because we believed that other SOS
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.94,0:47:27.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that we found my brother's Yukikaze on Enceladus.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.95,0:47:33.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.99,0:47:36.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.50,0:47:40.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the holdup?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.38,0:47:48.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew it...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.96,0:47:51.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.30,0:47:54.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been here before!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.18,0:48:00.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I was little, I went with my mother\Nwhen she was doing field research.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.38,0:48:05.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were in the Amazon!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.32,0:48:08.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This place looks exactly like what I saw there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.27,0:48:11.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't all jungles look the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.65,0:48:13.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course they don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.08,0:48:23.46,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Tactical Officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.13,0:48:28.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.70,0:48:31.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, I located what seems to be the signal's source...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.83,0:48:33.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.38,0:48:34.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.48,0:48:51.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks just like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.44,0:48:56.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks just like that sunken battleship\Nthe Yamato was camouflaged as.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.28,0:48:59.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Total length, 263 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.21,0:49:02.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Basic displacement, 64,000 tons.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.99,0:49:07.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Six 46cm guns mounted forward.\NThree mounted aft.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.75,0:49:11.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The largest surface vessel put to sea during the Pacific War.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.55,0:49:14.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Yamato, first ship of the Yamato class.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.38,0:49:18.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.01,0:49:25.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?!\NHow could that ship be here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.08,0:49:33.86,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,What in the world is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.86,0:49:36.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A place where the impossible becomes reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.68,0:49:39.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It means that this is that sort of place.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.70,0:49:43.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This structure covers the entire surface of the planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.95,0:49:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It would appear that we and the landing party\Nhave been physically separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.76,0:49:53.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.19,0:50:11.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This looks like a way in!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.64,0:50:45.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the‒? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.81,0:50:49.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From what I can see, this seems like a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.34,0:51:09.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Information Officer, the SOS has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.87,0:51:13.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the right place, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.04,0:51:16.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on? How is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.21,0:51:19.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been to this place, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.34,0:51:21.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.78,0:51:24.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Hotel Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.55,0:51:25.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.79,0:51:28.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,During the Pacific War, that's what it was called.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.31,0:51:31.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I care about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.26,0:51:39.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The numbers go up to 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.86,0:51:41.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It certainly doesn't seem that tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.25,0:51:55.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, I can't deal with this... This is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.38,0:51:59.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In any case‒
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.17,0:52:01.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tactical Officer! The door, it's‒
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.46,0:52:04.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the landing party!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.39,0:52:05.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stork, come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.93,0:52:08.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I repeat, Stork, come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.93,0:52:08.39,Dialogue2,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.64,0:52:10.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pull it together, Sawamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.14,0:52:14.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Analyzer?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.40,0:52:16.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come in, Analyzer!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.94,0:52:20.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no use. There's no response.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.24,0:52:30.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought somebody might come.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.29,0:52:33.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of all the stupid... Don't {\i1}do{\i} that!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.59,0:52:43.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Piano?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.09,0:52:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.30,0:52:50.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.26,0:52:51.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tactical Officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.08,0:53:19.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.46,0:53:21.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Melch, we've got guests!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.29,0:53:23.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like your hard work paid off.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.04,0:53:29.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here I thought we were rescued,\Nbut it's just a bunch of Saltzians...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.80,0:53:31.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sent the mayday?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.68,0:53:32.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.27,0:53:34.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Saltzians"?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.31,0:53:37.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As I recall, it's a planetary state that was annexed by Gamilas.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.65,0:53:40.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They seem to understand what we're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.28,0:53:51.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hadn't heard anything about a Saltzian unit\Nbeing deployed in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.24,0:53:55.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's news to me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.58,0:53:58.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What unit are you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.82,0:54:05.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were asked to identify your unit!\NAnswer the question, Saltzians!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.90,0:54:10.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.94,0:54:12.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you‒
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.43,0:54:14.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.30,0:54:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the‒?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.89,0:54:16.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.56,0:54:20.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised by anything here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.27,0:54:20.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So uncool.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.10,0:54:22.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Look who's talking! What's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.98,0:54:25.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my favorite outfit!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.28,0:54:34.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you can't tell us, you can't tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.35,0:54:36.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.24,0:54:38.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was a top-secret mission, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.50,0:54:41.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. We're not even allowed to discuss what unit we belong to.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.96,0:54:47.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I once knew some Saltzians like you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.76,0:54:51.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have a problem with sticklers like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.85,0:54:57.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Berger.\NFomt Berger.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.56,0:54:59.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Susumu Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.35,0:55:01.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kodai, huh?\NNice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.15,0:55:08.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We came to offer assistance, but the door vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.11,0:55:10.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The same thing happened to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.08,0:55:11.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.63,0:55:13.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't leave the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.04,0:55:19.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've tried everything we could think of,\Nbut we're still stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.92,0:55:23.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry we got you stuck in here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.20,0:55:26.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're kidding! There has to be a way out of this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.80,0:55:28.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go see for yourself, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.42,0:55:30.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine! I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.60,0:55:37.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no shortage of rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.51,0:55:40.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is amazing! It's so fancy!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.06,0:55:44.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's even a book set out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.50,0:55:48.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This takes me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.96,0:55:51.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a children's book I read as a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.16,0:55:54.41,Book01,,0,0,0,,{\move(586,121,588,159,21,3233)\frz354.5}{\blur0.7}The Helen‒
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.16,0:55:54.41,Book02,,0,0,0,,{\move(1140,135,1144,171,21,3233)\frz355}{\blur0.7}The Miracle Worker
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.53,0:55:54.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You read... this?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.99,0:55:55.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.91,0:55:59.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a story about a lonely witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.71,0:56:03.67,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Once upon a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.67,0:56:07.25,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,there was a large, blue land that lay far to the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.55,0:56:13.43,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,One day, a little girl arrived at the blue land.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.93,0:56:20.18,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,She had come to the blue land because she wanted human friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.27,0:56:26.79,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,But no one in the blue land would be her friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.79,0:56:29.20,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,She grew sad and cried out,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.57,0:56:32.94,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,"Why will no one be my friend?"
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.45,0:56:39.10,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,The people of the blue land hated the little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.10,0:56:42.40,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,They despise the strange power that the little girl has.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.41,0:56:45.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Strange power?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.17,0:56:48.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She could read people's minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.86,0:56:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's what's called a telepath.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.09,0:56:56.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because of that power, she can see what people are actually feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.23,0:56:58.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When she innocently tells others what she has seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.76,0:57:00.81,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,the people become overwhelmed with suspicions,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.81,0:57:02.74,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,begin to hate each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.74,0:57:05.42,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,and eventually, they begin to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.10,0:57:12.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The little girl, now a misanthrope, locks herself away in her home,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.61,0:57:15.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but the people who had come to fear her power
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.39,0:57:19.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,call her a witch and try to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.78,0:57:22.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.91,0:57:31.21,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,She sets out to find a faraway land\Nin a ship that God left for her out of pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.23,0:57:35.40,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,To the land of tomorrow,\Nwhich lies just beyond our sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.26,0:57:43.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just a fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.52,0:57:51.02,Book01,,0,0,0,,{\frz354.5\pos(590.667,132)}{\blur0.7}The Helen Keller\NStory
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.52,0:57:51.02,Book02,,0,0,0,,{\frz355\pos(1141.333,172)}{\blur0.7}The Miracle Worker
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.16,0:58:03.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that how you blow off steam?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.67,0:58:05.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.54,0:58:07.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, quite the resemblance, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.90,0:58:09.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.22,0:58:10.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What resembles what?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.23,0:58:32.06,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Bosun, how much longer will repairs take?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.06,0:58:35.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're double-timing it!\NCheck back in three hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.62,0:58:53.38,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,The day after we found ourselves trapped in the hotel,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.38,0:58:57.23,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,we began a strange communal life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.70,0:59:07.39,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,What we've learned
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.39,0:59:11.52,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,is that this hotel has four floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.92,0:59:15.52,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,But the indicator on the elevator goes up to 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.06,0:59:20.07,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,And that elevator seems to be broken because it won't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.07,0:59:23.56,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, we never found an exit leading to the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.91,0:59:26.87,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,The hotel's walls are tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.87,0:59:29.75,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We've tried to smash them, but can't make a dent.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.75,0:59:32.77,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We've tried everything that we could think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.54,0:59:34.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.92,0:59:38.17,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,But nothing has worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.78,0:59:40.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.16,0:59:44.43,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,The only thing that seemed to offer some hope
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.43,0:59:47.18,Hole,,0,0,0,,{\frz323.7\pos(653.333,717.333)}{\blur0.9}Sawamura's hole
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.30,0:59:49.18,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,was the hole that that dummy Sawamura fell into.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.02,0:59:56.38,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Maybe we're just deluding ourselves, but for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.38,0:59:59.00,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,digging this hole is our only way to make progress.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.57,1:00:08.58,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Strangely, we're being supplied with just water from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.33,1:00:13.25,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,If all this is deliberate on the part of the beings who created this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.25,1:00:16.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do they intend to do with us?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.75,1:00:20.42,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Our emergency provisions will run out soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.01,1:00:24.88,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We're okay for now and are sharing them with the Gamilans,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.18,1:00:28.61,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,but unless something changes, it won't be long before...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.64,1:00:37.52,Hunger,,0,0,0,,Hunger awakens conflict.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.11,1:00:39.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.49,1:00:43.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.08,1:00:45.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hunger...{\alpha&HFF&} awakens... conflict?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.35,1:00:47.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hunger... awakens...{\alpha&HFF&} conflict?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.41,1:00:49.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hunger... awakens... conflict?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.29,1:01:02.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The voice said, "hunger awakens conflict".
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.14,1:01:04.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In an alien language?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.92,1:01:08.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was definitely speaking Jirellan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.22,1:01:12.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Niimi said I was probably imagining things.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.52,1:01:16.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But when people are hungry, that's definitely what happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.65,1:01:23.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eat up.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.86,1:01:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't! Isn't that your last one?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.70,1:01:29.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me, I'm a guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.45,1:01:32.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.62,1:01:35.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.51,1:01:46.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look... If you say you heard it, you heard it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.00,1:01:48.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You believe me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.78,1:01:50.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.58,1:01:57.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe this crazy world is constructed from your memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.94,1:02:02.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You knew about the jungle and the battleship, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.32,1:02:06.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you also said that you'd been to this hotel before, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.65,1:02:07.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.07,1:02:11.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That just leaves the Jirellan voice you heard...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.24,1:02:13.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.83,1:02:16.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.08,1:02:18.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Jirellan voice
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.00,1:02:21.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is the ghost of a woman who was murdered in this hotel!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.33,1:02:23.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.67,1:02:28.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's an amusing way of looking at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.90,1:02:31.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Jirellans are an extinct race.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.75,1:02:35.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So in that sense, maybe they are something like ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.52,1:02:39.74,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,They think we're someone else for now,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.74,1:02:42.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but if they ever learn that we're Yamato crew members...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.73,1:02:45.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll worry about that if the time comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.23,1:02:48.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's possible for us to reach a mutual understanding with aliens.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.57,1:02:51.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what your brother said in his message.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.07,1:02:52.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.87,1:02:56.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can do it. It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.81,1:03:02.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sheesh!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.09,1:03:11.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Helen Keller was blind and deaf.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.93,1:03:16.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When she touched the water,\Nshe understood the relation between..."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.56,1:03:22.40,Hotel,,0,0,0,,{\frz344.6\frx12\fry14\pos(868,372.333)\fade(0,500)}{\blur0.9}Days Spent at the Hotel Yamato
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.65,1:03:21.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow will mark one week...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.73,1:03:23.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meria...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.07,1:03:37.70,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Enemy attack has set off a chain reaction in Block 5's energy tanks!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.70,1:03:41.88,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Evacuate immediately! Now sealing off Block 5!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.24,1:03:39.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meria!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.42,1:03:44.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meria!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.01,1:03:53.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meria!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.39,1:03:56.87,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.02,1:04:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.35,1:04:03.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were moaning, so I got worried.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.71,1:04:06.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. It's nothing you need to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.07,1:04:10.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.16,1:04:18.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not working, just give up!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.76,1:04:21.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll never get out no matter how much we dig!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.29,1:04:22.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just busywork!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.91,1:04:25.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to do it, you Saltzians can do it yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.66,1:04:28.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of‒
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.28,1:04:28.01,Dialogue2,,0,0,0,,Nobody's giving up!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.46,1:04:33.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gamilan soldiers do what needs to be done\Nbecause they have faith in possibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.09,1:04:35.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't give up until the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.34,1:04:38.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have nothing but respect for you, Major.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.91,1:04:41.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I can't stand to be around these people any longer!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.27,1:04:51.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that. He gets that way when he's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.49,1:04:54.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't give up until the bitter end, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.57,1:05:01.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's something somebody once told me.\NA superior officer I respected.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.16,1:05:04.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think our own captain said something like that once.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.71,1:05:07.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Don't give up to the bitter end!"
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.78,1:05:10.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a scary old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.34,1:05:13.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's an amazing person, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.91,1:05:16.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.26,1:05:19.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I'd like to meet your superior officer, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.68,1:05:24.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.23,1:05:27.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll go drag Melch back here by the scruff of his neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.40,1:05:33.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it, damn it!\NWhat a bunch of crap!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.50,1:05:45.71,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Don't overexert yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.21,1:05:54.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're hungry, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.15,1:06:11.23,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Long ago
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.23,1:06:14.23,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,he had a sweetheart named Meria.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.40,1:06:21.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unlike now, he was a upright, respectful young man back then.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.74,1:06:26.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm having trouble picturing that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.08,1:06:32.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those three were always together.\NHim, Meria, and Neredia.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.80,1:06:40.51,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,But after Meria died, he changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.01,1:06:44.51,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,She died right in front of him, and he couldn't save her.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.51,1:06:46.77,SubSubtitle,,0,50,0,,Meria Rikke
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.14,1:06:50.19,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,He's always dragging that around with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.31,1:06:57.02,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,And on top of that, he lost his comrades\Nand Gen. Domel, a man he looked up to,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.02,1:07:00.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in battle against the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.45,1:07:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only thing that keeps Berger going now
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.87,1:07:06.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is his thirst for revenge against the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.29,1:07:08.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.54,1:07:15.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who was that "Meria" you mentioned last night?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.00,1:07:17.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meria is Neredia's little sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.47,1:07:21.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She {\i1}was{\i} her little sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.18,1:07:23.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Was"?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.01,1:07:26.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have any siblings?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.78,1:07:27.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.52,1:07:33.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have someone who's like a big brother,\NI guess. He has a scar just like yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.61,1:07:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm flattered.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.44,1:07:39.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.36,1:07:40.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Fomt" is fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.72,1:07:46.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fomt, what sort of race were the Jirellans?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.37,1:07:52.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're witches.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.25,1:07:53.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Witches?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.75,1:07:56.54,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,It's a story about a lonely witch.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.00,1:08:00.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They read people's minds.\NThey're like monsters out of stories.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.34,1:08:03.76,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,The people who had come to fear her power
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.76,1:08:07.31,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,call her a witch and try to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.06,1:08:10.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Jirellans all died out, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.85,1:08:14.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Oh, there were two on Gamilas.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.30,1:08:16.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they were the only survivors.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.91,1:08:21.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Neredia said that there weren't any Jirellans left anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.00,1:08:23.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If there's just two women, the race is as good as extinct.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.07,1:08:29.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.16,1:08:30.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.04,1:08:31.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.92,1:08:44.05,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Video message from the homeworld!\NFirst Minister Sabera!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.60,1:08:53.77,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Report, mighty Thunderclap.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.19,1:08:57.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We still have no firm leads.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.69,1:09:03.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, I have another prize.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.28,1:09:05.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is sure to be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.32,1:09:06.12,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Simpleton!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.03,1:09:11.93,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,His Majesty desires the prize he ordered you to claim!\NThe World of Tranquility!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.93,1:09:14.75,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Press on with the capture of the secret Aquarian techniques
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.75,1:09:17.12,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,that are hidden there, their cloaking technology!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.79,1:09:23.13,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,The empire desires technology to uphold\Nits national polity and establish hegemony.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.63,1:09:26.92,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Should you fail to locate the World of Tranquility,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.92,1:09:29.39,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,make amends with your death.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.18,1:09:31.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Minister.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.14,1:09:32.94,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,I await the good news.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.43,1:09:36.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stupid little girl...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.65,1:09:37.65,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.92,1:09:40.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've located traces of a spatial jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.99,1:09:44.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good! We will now pursue the Terron ship!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.32,1:09:46.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the First Minister said to‒
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.65,1:09:48.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care what she said!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.49,1:09:51.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All ships, take up positions for spatial jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.87,1:09:58.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Helen Keller was blind and deaf.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.50,1:10:05.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All she had
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.80,1:10:07.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was the sense of touch."
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.89,1:10:13.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Jirellan writing!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.02,1:10:17.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Eyes reflect darkness,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.30,1:10:19.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and ears hear silence.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.81,1:10:25.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who take the darkness to be reality\Nand are swallowed up by the silence,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.28,1:10:29.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will destroy themselves through their mutual distrust.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.70,1:10:32.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who attain the 11th level
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.74,1:10:35.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will see the world for what it truly is."
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.17,1:10:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The 11th level?!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.66,1:10:48.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does it mean this?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.57,1:11:06.24,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Come here, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.99,1:11:10.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.56,1:12:25.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You came here to steal this, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.17,1:12:52.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In ancient times, the World of Tranquility\Nis said to have shone in a dull gray sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.92,1:12:55.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The hand of Heaven must be at work!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.81,1:13:00.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because we pursued the Terron ship,\Nwe have found the treasure world!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.68,1:13:03.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is {\i1}my{\i} glory!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.02,1:13:05.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't surrender it to that little girl!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.90,1:13:15.00,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Identifying vessels that have appeared in orbit!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.00,1:13:16.09,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Gatlantean!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.49,1:13:18.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's those damn barbarians...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.78,1:13:21.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.54,1:13:30.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way! There wasn't a stairway here before!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.21,1:13:38.05,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,These people are the enemy. This food is ours alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.18,1:13:42.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!\NThis belongs to us!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.89,1:13:46.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the‒?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.64,1:13:48.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This must be the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.49,1:13:55.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Any sign of them?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.91,1:13:57.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sawamura!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.89,1:14:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay back!\NThis food is ours!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.12,1:14:05.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's none for you Saltzians!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.62,1:14:07.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Melch! Stop acting stupid!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.87,1:14:11.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you saying, Major?!\NWe can't trust these people!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.88,1:14:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That isn't food!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.79,1:14:14.76,Dialogue2,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.42,1:14:17.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did he get a gun?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.49,1:14:18.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.53,1:14:22.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come now, you have them, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.48,1:14:29.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Melch!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.98,1:14:34.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have to come to your senses, Major!\NSaltzians can't be trusted!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.19,1:14:35.99,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.74,1:14:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't coexist with Terrons!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.36,1:14:49.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Terrons?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.11,1:14:52.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've been deceived all this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.62,1:14:55.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These people aren't Saltzians.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.63,1:14:58.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The man standing next to you is a member of the Yamato's crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.01,1:15:01.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, that's crazy. Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.68,1:15:06.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it...\NYou're one of them?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.32,1:15:16.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.65,1:15:19.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't {\i1}you{\i} shoot?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.45,1:15:25.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Berger, we fought against Gen. Domel.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.29,1:15:30.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He worried about his men to the very end.\NHe remained true to his principles.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.63,1:15:32.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?\NHe killed him!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.90,1:15:36.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your comrades! Gen. Domel!\NThese people killed them!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.57,1:15:38.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're your sworn enemy!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.10,1:15:40.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.80,1:15:44.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we were born on different worlds,\Nwe can understand each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.49,1:15:47.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's awfully idealistic.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.47,1:15:50.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's something my brother left in a message before he died.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.11,1:15:59.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shoot him, Berger!\NShoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.99,1:16:03.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think it's time...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.77,1:16:05.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...we ended this little farce!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.70,1:16:11.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deep down, I always suspected.\NThat you were behind all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.17,1:16:15.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.58,1:16:18.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't react at all when you saw Kiryu.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.71,1:16:22.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though she's the spitting image of your own sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.14,1:16:24.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.18,1:16:28.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the real Neredia calls me Fomt.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.14,1:16:36.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't probe your memories well enough, I see.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.93,1:16:40.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Uninvited guests have arrived.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.01,1:17:05.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.72,1:17:15.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kodai! I got through to the Stork!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.73,1:17:19.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What in the world?!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.15,1:17:28.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it... These men were Gatlantean!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.39,1:17:32.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you lure them here?\NLike you did with us?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.46,1:17:36.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They came here in search of this world's power.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.71,1:17:41.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But in the end, they were driven by their mistrust to destroy one another.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.88,1:17:45.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And the same should have happened to you.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.45,1:17:49.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This world is sacred ground to us Jirellans.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.82,1:17:53.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our progenitor, Shambleau of Aquarius.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.93,1:17:55.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew it! A Jirellan!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.94,1:17:57.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why go to all this trouble?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.58,1:17:58.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Neredia?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.92,1:18:01.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She was never here.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.20,1:18:02.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.03,1:18:03.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She is outside this world.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.44,1:18:07.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She never came to the hotel.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.65,1:18:10.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You manipulated his memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.26,1:18:13.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like on the Yamato that time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.50,1:18:16.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was the doing of two who had gone over to Gamilas' cause.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.29,1:18:18.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.76,1:18:21.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When our homeworld fell,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.96,1:18:26.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the handful of pilgrims who were here escaped its destruction.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.57,1:18:30.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.51,1:18:35.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"By the wall, I will say a word to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.51,1:18:38.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take my word.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.18,1:18:41.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give ear to my instructions."
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.70,1:18:43.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It meant this?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.12,1:18:52.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiryu!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.48,1:18:55.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Seeds were sown across the galaxies.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.04,1:18:59.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seven days after those seeds, the many races, gather here,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.83,1:19:02.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,make your hearts one.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.38,1:19:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enter the ring of light
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.17,1:19:08.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and join hands,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.43,1:19:13.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you brothers of the galaxies who all share the genes of Aquarius.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.53,1:19:16.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do so, and the seal will be broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.06,1:19:18.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Odyssey of the Celestial Ark...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.06,1:19:18.31,Dialogue2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Odyssey of the Celestial Ark...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.47,1:19:22.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...awaken from your long slumber."
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.47,1:19:22.90,Dialogue2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...awaken from your long slumber."{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.40,1:19:31.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.67,1:19:36.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Leaving our place of refuge and setting out again...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.26,1:19:39.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We cannot do that.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.04,1:19:42.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if you lock yourselves away in here,\Nyou're only waiting for extinction.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.27,1:19:44.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.05,1:19:45.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So will we.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.55,1:19:49.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do we... have a tomorrow?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.51,1:19:50.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.72,1:19:55.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Loerelai Loer.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.10,1:19:59.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's‒
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.00,1:20:05.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Our origin."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.12,1:20:06.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Time is cyclical."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.15,1:20:09.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Setting out."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.49,1:20:11.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Preserving the species."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.13,1:20:13.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Rejuvenation."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.56,1:20:14.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Birth."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.16,1:20:17.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Humanoid shape..."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.53,1:20:54.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.66,1:20:56.41,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Your ride is here!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.58,1:21:01.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Analyzer!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.96,1:21:07.17,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Burn it to ash!\NSmoke them out!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.63,1:21:10.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thrash those who would defy the empire!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.75,1:21:13.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now is our chance to seize the treasure world!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.99,1:21:43.50,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Hull repairs complete!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.85,1:21:46.12,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,The planetary surface appears to be crumbling!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.75,1:21:48.25,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Yamato, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.49,1:21:49.72,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Stork here!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.72,1:21:52.38,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Now returning to the Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.55,1:21:59.72,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Survey team's launch is aboard!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.51,1:22:03.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's always making me worry...\NThat idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.95,1:22:06.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The launch is leaving the Lambeer!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.23,1:22:12.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.52,1:22:14.01,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Beginning approach.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.57,1:22:17.61,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,This is the Mirangal.\NYou are cleared to land.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.22,1:22:24.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.62,1:22:26.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll file a report later.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.51,1:22:27.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's our situation?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.41,1:22:30.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy has set up a blockade in orbit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.54,1:22:34.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's probably just a matter of time\Nbefore they launch an all-out offensive.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.10,1:22:38.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Commander, would you give me command\Nfor the duration of the battle?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.80,1:22:39.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.72,1:22:41.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have a shot at victory.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.14,1:22:52.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have an idea for how to counter\Nthe enemy's out-of-range attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.83,1:22:57.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On my authority as first officer,\NI hereby transfer command to the Tactical Officer.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.59,1:22:59.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.41,1:23:04.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From here on out, you are in command of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.72,1:23:05.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.67,1:23:23.97,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We intend to hold them off and make sure\Nthe old-timers and kids make it home!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.73,1:23:28.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the rest of you are Gamilan men, you should understand this!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.87,1:23:30.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me your trust
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.73,1:23:31.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.19,1:23:33.74,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zar belk!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.65,1:23:43.49,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Garle Gamilon! Garle Gamilon!\NGarle Gamilon! Garle Gamilon!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.42,1:24:02.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Objects surfacing off our 9 o'clock!\NGamilan ships!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.69,1:24:17.19,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Gamilan fleet is pulling alongside the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.86,1:24:18.90,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Stand by to attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.90,1:24:21.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold your fire.\NThey're on our side.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.74,1:24:25.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hang on, when you said we had a shot...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.70,1:24:29.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.\NWe aren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.95,1:24:32.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Attention, all hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.87,1:24:36.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Yamato will now engage the enemy\Nin tandem with the Gamilan fleet
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.54,1:24:37.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and destroy them!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.34,1:24:42.94,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Launch all fighter squadron aircraft.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.94,1:24:45.76,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Commence joint operation with Gamilan fighters.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.43,1:24:49.85,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,I repeat, launch all fighter squadron aircraft.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.28,1:25:04.45,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,This is 104, Sawamura!\NLaunching!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.51,1:25:24.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Klim Melch, launching!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.22,1:25:30.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alpha 2, Yamamoto!\NLaunching!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.73,1:25:40.48,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,The combined air wing will intercept\Nthe carriers closing in from our right flank.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.48,1:25:44.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Yamato and the Berger fleet will halt\Nthe advance of the main enemy force!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.57,1:25:47.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All hands to battle formation!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.74,1:25:50.66,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Deploy battle deck!\NAll hands to battle formation!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.54,1:26:39.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's that attack...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.16,1:26:40.25,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,It's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.75,1:26:43.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We detected a spatial wave motion echo in the enemy's attack
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.85,1:26:46.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that's identical to what we saw in the Rainbow Cluster battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.69,1:26:51.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's only 73% accurate, but we can predict the emergence coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.14,1:26:53.40,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Where did that come from?!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.40,1:26:55.73,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nirvales destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.31,1:26:55.74,Off-Screen2,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Unable to compute trajectory!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.48,1:26:53.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.39,1:26:57.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...a transport system?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.02,1:26:58.14,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,This is the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.94,1:27:01.44,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Transmitting enemy prediction data.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.44,1:27:04.33,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Link all your ships to counter their attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.11,1:27:13.24,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Incoming!\NBearing, 33! VS4!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.25,1:27:23.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes! It works!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.63,1:27:27.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why does it not hit them?!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.84,1:27:29.17,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.72,1:27:31.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The planet! It's‒
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.10,1:27:35.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Commander! Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.69,1:27:48.77,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Unusual phenomena detected around planet!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.17,1:27:50.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Structure closing in from above!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.41,1:28:02.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is this world's true form...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.71,1:28:11.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The planet...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.89,1:28:15.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.10,1:28:17.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is an emergency message from the First Minister.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.94,1:28:23.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To what do I owe‒
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.60,1:28:27.40,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Is it true that you have located the world?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.90,1:28:29.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.19,1:28:31.40,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Halt your attack at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.49,1:28:34.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How unusual.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.49,1:28:37.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am moments from destroying the Terron Yamatte
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.33,1:28:39.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and those blue Gamilan vermin‒
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.67,1:28:41.16,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.57,1:28:45.00,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,How dare you damage the world I mean to present to His Majesty?!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.00,1:28:46.08,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Imbecile!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.34,1:28:51.40,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,As one would expect from the former head of a gang of brigands.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.40,1:28:54.68,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,You were not worthy to wield the Firestorm Direct Strike Gun
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.68,1:28:57.03,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,that our Gamilan science slaves constructed.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.03,1:28:58.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.44,1:29:07.65,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Enemy fleet now in firing range!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.19,1:29:11.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even without the Wave Motion Gun...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.03,1:29:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Yamato can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.78,1:29:20.66,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Enemy fleet closing in further!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.66,1:29:24.04,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Have the Kiska squadron form up and attack from their flank!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.54,1:29:27.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As for us, we will take the Yamatte's head!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.13,1:29:30.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Slay the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.30,1:29:32.41,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We'll crown ourselves with glory!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.14,1:29:38.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.95,1:30:05.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Target enemy flagship!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.45,1:30:06.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ranging complete!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.92,1:30:09.96,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Targeting complete!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.96,1:30:11.06,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.76,1:30:21.76,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Kiska here, we are about to enter combat airspace.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.23,1:30:29.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going down!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.44,1:30:34.87,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We're under attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.87,1:30:37.36,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,They must have approached using the rings' ice for cover.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.36,1:30:38.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Such insolence...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.36,1:30:40.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anti-air combat!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.37,1:30:50.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sawamura, let's finish off that cruiser!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.25,1:30:55.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nemoto!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.57,1:31:22.32,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,My hand slipped.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.70,1:31:28.00,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Yamatte closing in!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.00,1:31:31.25,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Heavy damage to energy transfer conduits!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.10,1:31:31.25,Off-Screen2,,0,0,0,,Firestorm Direct Strike Gun offline!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.79,1:31:33.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn them...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.17,1:31:35.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Point the bow towards the planet!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.42,1:31:39.76,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We'll seize the core of the planet ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.14,1:31:42.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enemy flagship has deserted the battle line.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.70,1:31:44.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,New course, descent trajectory towards planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.77,1:31:49.18,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What's going on?! Requesting orders! Requesting orders!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.43,1:31:48.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Megaruda has deserted the battle line!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.18,1:31:51.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Friendlies are requesting instructions!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.08,1:31:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Capt. Parakas?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.27,1:31:54.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dagum!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.12,1:31:57.20,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,And you call yourself a warrior?!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.78,1:32:05.78,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Major! The Lambeer has run aground!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.78,1:32:08.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're stuck in the planet's surface and are unable to move!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.71,1:32:12.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lambeer stranding point is along the enemy flagship's course!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.62,1:32:15.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-It's what?!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.55,1:32:22.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.88,1:32:24.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try using the gravity balancers!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.83,1:32:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.40,1:32:30.47,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Enemy ship detected in orbit!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.52,1:32:42.65,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.82,1:32:46.43,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,The Lambeer's run aground on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.43,1:32:50.73,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Let us handle these guys!\NGo rescue them with the Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.73,1:32:53.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You only have a handful of ships!\NCan you handle them, Berger?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.25,1:32:57.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm giving you a plum role here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.30,1:32:59.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and do me this favor, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.38,1:33:03.01,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about us.\NWe'll get out of this on our own.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.93,1:33:08.93,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Would you do as I say for once?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.93,1:33:10.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fomt...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.14,1:33:15.47,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Down there...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.98,1:33:19.02,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,I ran into Meria.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.11,1:33:21.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.08,1:33:25.35,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,When we get back home, I'll tell you all about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.70,1:33:27.95,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Be seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.16,1:33:32.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That fool...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.09,1:33:41.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're changing course!\NHard to port!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.47,1:33:51.43,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We will now pursue the enemy flagship!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.23,1:34:01.58,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We've cleared their air patrol!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.58,1:34:02.86,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,They're all yours!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.90,1:34:07.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is no longer any honor in this battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.16,1:34:08.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inform all ships!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.77,1:34:10.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enemy fighter overhead!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.37,1:34:14.22,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Melch, you're too far ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.71,1:34:24.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got him...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.51,1:34:31.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Melch... Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.55,1:35:17.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A death like this... I'm okay with.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.52,1:35:23.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Neredi. I don't think I'll be making it home.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.57,1:35:34.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yamazaki, can you give me 100% in this situation?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.83,1:35:37.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I cut the power going to the Wave Motion Barrier and main guns
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.76,1:35:40.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and patch in the auxiliaries, it should work. No, it will work!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.79,1:35:41.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.38,1:35:48.93,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Gamilan ship dead ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.97,1:35:53.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a nuisance!\NButcher them!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.14,1:35:57.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yamatte closing in at high speed!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.60,1:36:04.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I laugh!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.97,1:36:12.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Use Type-3's!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.06,1:36:12.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.53,1:36:15.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll turn the tables on them!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.12,1:36:19.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Megaruda has no blind spots!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.54,1:36:23.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Obliterate them!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.39,1:36:37.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shima!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.02,1:36:37.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got this!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.28,1:36:53.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stand by to fire rocket anchor!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.11,1:36:56.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Target their starboard stern!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.12,1:36:56.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Roger!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.83,1:36:58.91,Anchor,,0,0,0,,{\frz0.994\pos(731,938)}{\blur0.7}Ready to drop anchor
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.20,1:36:59.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready to fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.50,1:37:00.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Drop anchor!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.37,1:37:01.04,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.92,1:37:09.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.69,1:37:27.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reel in the anchor!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.41,1:37:40.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Close-quarters combat!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.33,1:37:50.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't lose!\NThe Megaruda will never lose!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.39,1:38:06.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All stations, prepare for combat!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.98,1:38:10.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Smash them!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.73,1:38:12.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.20,1:38:19.45,SubSubtitle,,0,0,0,,Glory to‒
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.67,1:38:32.55,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Enemy ship seems to have exploded!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.55,1:38:34.12,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,We're free of the obstruction!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.12,1:38:35.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They did it?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.72,1:38:36.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the Yamato's status?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.84,1:39:20.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about Fomt?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.28,1:39:49.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meria, I tried to join you but failed again...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.29,1:40:34.35,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,The week we spent on that world in that hotel
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.35,1:40:38.25,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,was apparently just half a day to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.97,1:40:46.55,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,This world is a relic of the ancient Aquarius civilization.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.30,1:40:51.13,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,The Jirellan's holy land, hidden away in the dull gray skies,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.13,1:40:54.02,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,as well as a space ark that travels the galaxies.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.86,1:41:00.73,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,I wonder if all our races really can trace\Ntheir origins back to the same source...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.28,1:41:06.24,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Did the Aquarians believe that the seeds they had sown
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.24,1:41:10.24,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,would eventually sprout not into conflict, but rather trust?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.20,1:41:14.00,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,No one will ever know.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.21,1:41:21.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.35,1:41:29.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's vanishing!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.64,1:41:30.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sanada?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.72,1:41:33.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To be able to cloak a mass of that scale...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.56,1:41:36.12,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,This is science beyond our comprehension.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.52,1:41:44.36,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Finally, the ark set out into the sea of stars.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.79,1:41:52.64,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Having lost their home, the Jirellans\Nmight be cosmic vagabonds forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.80,1:41:58.00,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,But it's the same thing as us that allows\Nthem to continue on their voyage.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.29,1:42:02.00,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,A hope for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.88,1:42:10.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Farewell, farewell, my friend.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.09,1:42:09.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.31,1:42:17.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}This is a brief goodbye for now.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.65,1:42:23.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Farewell, farewell, my friend.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.44,1:42:30.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}This is a brief goodbye for now.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.49,1:42:33.16,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Let's meet again one day somewhere out here in these skies.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.52,1:42:35.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Though our bodies may go their separate ways,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.29,1:42:37.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a pretty good farewell, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.61,1:42:42.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Our hearts will remain as one.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.69,1:43:10.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All ahead half!\NSet sail for Earth!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.54,1:43:22.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our journey is not yet over.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.79,1:43:28.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To give hope to our homeland, the ship travels on.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.61,1:44:37.72,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Fires resulting from riots\Nhave broken out in sectors 8 and 21!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.72,1:44:40.58,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Riot suppression has resulted\Nin heavy casualties
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.58,1:44:42.58,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,to both civilians and security forces.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.08,1:44:46.09,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Contaminated area spreading!\NSealing off through level 17.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.09,1:44:48.09,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Issuing mandatory evacuation order.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.86,1:44:50.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been 324 days since the Yamato left Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.09,1:44:54.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The one-year time limit will be up in just 41 days...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.51,1:44:59.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.02,1:45:00.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will the Yamato really‒
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.27,1:45:02.44,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.27,1:45:02.43,Off-Screen2,,0,0,0,,Hijikata!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.43,1:45:03.40,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.76,1:45:04.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you are?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.81,1:45:08.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hajime Saito, formerly of the 7th Cosmo Marine Regiment!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.32,1:45:12.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He has something to say to me.\NLet's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.78,1:45:20.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I may speak freely, we're putting down riots day after day!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.99,1:45:24.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've had it up to here with pointing my gun at civilians!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.46,1:45:31.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cosmo Marine guns aren't meant to be turned on fellow humans!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.07,1:45:37.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How long is this hell going to go on?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.13,1:45:41.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My best friend told me that he would return, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.27,1:45:44.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And he will!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.59,1:45:47.81,Off-Screen,,0,0,0,,Cdr. Hijikata!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.31,1:45:51.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're picking up a hyperspace message\Nfrom outside the solar system!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.96,1:45:53.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Video transmission!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.70,1:45:59.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's... It's the Yamato!
